### GENERATED FILE - do not hand-edit. Regenerate with: tools/generate_perk_editor.ps1
### Per-perk toggle grid for the DI dynasty perk editor.
### Owned state IS rendered via pure datafunction bindings (gold border +
### checkmark; fully-owned tracks tint gold). Buttons stay enabled for left-add /
### right-remove.
### left click = add (no-op if already owned via the add SGUI's is_shown guard),
### right click = remove (no-op if not owned). Out-of-order add/remove is intended.

